MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- migration: ALTER TABLE attempts ADD COLUMN model_output TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT ''
- AttemptReport: add model_output field (raw LLM JSON before HTTP overwrite)
- record_attempt: accept model_output param, include in INSERT
- get_execution_report: SELECT model_output, populate AttemptReport
- orchestrator: save response.output before combined_output overwrite; pass raw_model_output to all 6 call sites

Previously the report's 'output' column held only the HTTP server response body,
making it impossible to tell from the report what JSON the model had actually sent.
