MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

GPT review correctly identified that the previous placement (after shell
processing) was wrong — if shell modifies response.output, the saved
'raw' value would no longer be the original LLM output.

Move the capture to immediately after LlmResponded event, before any
shell/JSON/transform processing. All 6 call sites now pass the same
truly-raw value.
---
