- migration: ALTER TABLE attempts ADD COLUMN request_sent TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT ''
- AttemptReport: add request_sent field
- record_attempt: accept and INSERT request_sent
- get_execution_report: SELECT request_sent, populate AttemptReport
- orchestrator: initialize request_sent='' at top of attempt loop,
  update to payload_str just before executor.execute(),
  pass &request_sent to all 6 call sites

Report now has three fields per attempt:
  model_output  — raw LLM output (before shell/transform)
  request_sent  — final payload sent to executor (after transform)
  output        — HTTP response body from target server
